    thinking: "**Analyzing Build Errors**\n\nI\'ve just removed the `layout.tsx` file to simplify things, hoping to pinpoint the source of the build errors. Unfortunately, I\'m still encountering issues when prerendering pages like `/search`, `/`, and `/participant/1`. The errors persist, and I am still trying to debug them.\n\n\n**Unraveling `usePathname()`**\n\nI\'ve made a breakthrough! It seems the `Next.js` `Link` component internally leverages `usePathname()` through `useContext(PathnameContext)`! This explains why removing the `layout.tsx` file didn\'t fix the prerendering errors. I\'m now certain `Link` is the culprit, triggering the `Cannot read properties of null` error because of the prerendering context. I will adjust the link strategy for `/contest/1`.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 961581807
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
