    thinking: "**Isolating Core Components**\n\nI\'ve just finished isolating the core components. I removed the imports of `ReduxProvider`, `AuthProvider`, `AppShell`, and `PwaRegister` from `src/app/layout.tsx`. This now makes the layout self-contained. Also, `src/app/page.tsx` is completely self-contained, returning a simple \"Home\" div.\n\n\n**Debugging Next.js Failure**\n\nI\'m now investigating the Next.js default `_not-found` page failure. The error, \"Cannot read properties of null (reading \'useContext\')\", is puzzling. I checked React versions, as Next.js 14 uses `react 18.2.0` and `react-dom 18.2.0`. I\'m also exploring client vs. server component interactions, and the influence of `globals.css` and `metadata` in `layout.tsx`. I ruled out `react-redux` and `supabase` as possible causes.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 632496061
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
